<section class="section wrap interface-showcase" id="interface-showcase">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <span class="eyebrow"><i></i> Inside the dashboard</span>
    <h2>See the traffic path.<br /><span>Then filter to what matters.</span></h2>
    <p>Explore an environment-wide topology and keep the familiar filters close at hand. The views below use illustrative data.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="interface-grid">
    <article class="interface-card">
      <div class="interface-card-heading">
        <div><span class="eyebrow">Topology overview</span><h3>Follow each connection</h3></div>
        <span class="interface-badge"><i></i> 1 unavailable</span>
      </div>
      <div class="interface-topology-canvas">
        <svg class="interface-topology-svg" viewBox="0 0 800 370" role="img" aria-label="Illustrative topology from HAProxy target through a frontend and backend to four servers">
          <g class="interface-topology-edges">
            <path d="M400 72 C400 88 400 94 400 110" />
            <path class="route" d="M400 162 C400 180 400 186 400 204" />
            <path d="M400 256 C400 274 105 276 105 302" />
            <path d="M400 256 C400 274 295 276 295 302" />
            <path d="M400 256 C400 274 485 276 485 302" />
            <path d="M400 256 C400 274 675 276 675 302" />
          </g>
          <g class="interface-node target-node" transform="translate(305 20)">
            <rect width="190" height="52" rx="11"/><circle cx="15" cy="18" r="4"/><text x="28" y="22">edge-01</text><text class="node-meta" x="14" y="40">HAProxy target · online</text>
          </g>
          <g class="interface-node frontend-node" transform="translate(305 110)">
            <rect width="190" height="52" rx="11"/><circle cx="15" cy="18" r="4"/><text x="28" y="22">public</text><text class="node-meta" x="14" y="40">Frontend · OPEN</text>
          </g>
          <g class="interface-node backend-node" transform="translate(305 204)">
            <rect width="190" height="52" rx="11"/><circle cx="15" cy="18" r="4"/><text x="28" y="22">web-production</text><text class="node-meta" x="14" y="40">Backend · 3 / 4 UP</text>
          </g>
          <g class="interface-node server-node" transform="translate(30 302)">
            <rect width="150" height="48" rx="10"/><circle cx="14" cy="17" r="4"/><text x="27" y="21">web-01</text><text class="node-meta" x="13" y="38">UP · L7 OK</text>
          </g>
          <g class="interface-node server-node" transform="translate(220 302)">
            <rect width="150" height="48" rx="10"/><circle cx="14" cy="17" r="4"/><text x="27" y="21">web-02</text><text class="node-meta" x="13" y="38">UP · L7 OK</text>
          </g>
          <g class="interface-node server-node down-node" transform="translate(410 302)">
            <rect width="150" height="48" rx="10"/><circle cx="14" cy="17" r="4"/><text x="27" y="21">web-03</text><text class="node-meta" x="13" y="38">DOWN · L4 error</text>
          </g>
          <g class="interface-node server-node" transform="translate(600 302)">
            <rect width="150" height="48" rx="10"/><circle cx="14" cy="17" r="4"/><text x="27" y="21">web-04</text><text class="node-meta" x="13" y="38">UP · L7 OK</text>
          </g>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="interface-caption"><span>HAProxy → frontend → backend → servers</span><span>Read-only</span></div>
    </article>

    <article class="interface-card">
      <div class="interface-card-heading">
        <div><span class="eyebrow">View controls</span><h3>Filter &amp; sort</h3></div>
        <span class="interface-close" aria-hidden="true">×</span>
      </div>
      <div class="interface-filter-grid">
        <section class="interface-filter-group">
          <h4>Sort by</h4>
          <div class="interface-select">Configuration order <span>⌄</span></div>
          <div class="interface-select secondary-select">Ascending <span>⌄</span></div>
        </section>
        <section class="interface-filter-group">
          <h4>HAProxy servers</h4>
          <div class="interface-filter-option"><i class="fake-check checked"></i> edge-01</div>
          <div class="interface-filter-option"><i class="fake-check checked"></i> edge-02</div>
          <div class="interface-filter-option"><i class="fake-check checked"></i> edge-03</div>
        </section>
        <section class="interface-filter-group backend-filter-group">
          <h4>Backends &amp; servers</h4>
          <div class="interface-filter-option"><i class="fake-check checked"></i> web-production</div>
          <div class="interface-filter-option nested-filter"><i class="fake-check checked"></i> web-01 <small>UP</small></div>
          <div class="interface-filter-option nested-filter"><i class="fake-check checked"></i> web-02 <small>UP</small></div>
          <div class="interface-filter-option nested-filter down-filter"><i class="fake-check checked"></i> web-03 <small>DOWN</small></div>
          <div class="interface-filter-option nested-filter"><i class="fake-check checked"></i> web-04 <small>UP</small></div>
        </section>
      </div>
      <div class="interface-caption"><span>Choose targets, frontends, backends and servers</span><span>Saved per browser</span></div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
